  "statuteText": "169-B:38 Penalty for Forbidden Publication. –\n\nThe publisher of any newspaper or the manager, owner or person in control of a radio or television station or agent or employee of any of the above who violates any provision of RSA 169-B:37 shall be guilty of a misdemeanor."
